# SaaSKit (ProKit core) repo rules
- Docs in /docs and /instructions are authoritative for this repo.
- Primary deploy path is Dokploy + Nixpacks; Dockerfile is optional only.
- APP_SLUG must match the repo/project name; tenant schema is tenant_<slug>.
- Keep scripts in scripts/runtime and scripts/db intact unless explicitly asked.
- Prefer minimal, targeted changes over large refactors.
- Production deploys are tag-gated only.
- Production is hands-off: never suggest running provisioning/migrations manually in production. Deploy by tag; the runtime gate runs db:init + migrations.
